# Shell registry — the one list of shells, read by both runtimes:
#   ~/.config/hypr/hyprland.lua  (which Hyprland config to dofile)
#   scripts/lib/shell-common.sh  (switch-shell.sh, edit-hypr.sh, doctor.sh, picker)
#
# One record per line, in picker order:  name|config|icon|blurb
#   name    switch-shell.sh / edit-hypr.sh argument and the active.conf value
#   config  the shell's Hyprland Lua config; "~/" = $HOME, otherwise relative
#           to ~/.config/hypr
#   icon    file under dotfiles/fuzzel/shell-icons (omarchy is a .png on
#           purpose: upstream's only SVG is a wide black wordmark, unusable at
#           icon size on a dark picker)
#   blurb   picker label suffix
#
# Adding a shell here is necessary but not sufficient — see the "New shell"
# checklist in docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
caelestia|~/.local/share/caelestia/hypr/hyprland.lua|caelestia.svg|Material You, softly glowing
ambxst|~/.local/share/ambxst/hyprland.lua|ambxst.svg|Astal-built command deck
dms|shells/dms/hyprland.lua|dms.svg|Dux Shell · the Dank lineage, reborn
noctalia|shells/noctalia/hyprland.lua|noctalia.svg|A quiet night sky · native, Qt-free
end4|shells/end4/hyprland.lua|end4.svg|Illogical Impulse · the showpiece rice
end4pc|shells/end4pc/hyprland.lua|end4pc.svg|Illogical Impulse, remixed by pctrade
omarchy|shells/omarchy/hyprland.lua|omarchy.png|DHH's opinionated Arch, in quickshell
xenon|shells/xenon/hyprland.lua|xenon.svg|MannuVilasara's lean quickshell take
glyph|shells/glyph/hyprland.lua|glyph.svg|Nothing-OS dots & dot-matrix soul
ryoku|shells/ryoku/hyprland.lua|ryoku.png|The whole Ryoku desktop, as shipped
